 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Adam, the angels, the jinn and Iblis are never drawn; no fire for «نار السموم» and no clay figure. Geometric only on «وإن ربك» and «قال ربك» (gone before «للملائكة»). 29:3-6 («ونفخت فيه من روحي») is not glossed; 29:7-9 carries Al-Muyassar's «سجود تحية وتكريم، لا سجود عبادة». 27:2-4 is not glossed (the vocalised «قبل» would repeat the passage)."
